 #: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:29(para)
 msgid ""
-"When you add text, vector or link layers to an image, <acronym>GIMP</"
-"acronym> stores specific information for that <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
-"types\">layer type</link>. This command lets you discard this information, "
-"transforming the selected layers into normal bitmap layers."
-msgstr ""
+"When you add text, vector or link layers to an image, "
+"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> stores specific information for that <link "
+"linkend=\"gimp-layer-types\">layer type</link>. This command lets you "
+"discard this information, transforming the selected layers into normal "
+"bitmap layers."
+msgstr ""
+"När du lägger till text-, vektor- eller länkade lager i en bild lagrar "
+"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> särskild information om <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-"
+"types\">lagertypen</link>. Kommandot tar bort informationen och omvandlar de"
+" markerade lagren till vanliga rasterlager."
 
 #: src/menus/layer/text-discard.xml:36(para)
 msgid ""
 "Note that if you try to perform a graphic operation like painting to one of "
-"these special layer types, it will blink and show a warning that you need to "
-"rasterize the layer first. By undoing or using <guilabel>Revert Rasterize</"
-"guilabel> you can revert the layer back to the layer type it was before "
-"rasterizing."
-msgstr ""
+"these special layer types, it will blink and show a warning that you need to"
+" rasterize the layer first. By undoing or using <guilabel>Revert "
+"Rasterize</guilabel> you can revert the layer back to the layer type it was "
+"before rasterizing."
+msgstr ""
+"Om du försöker måla på någon av de här speciallagren blinkar lagret och "
+"visar en varning om att du först måste rastrera det. Ångra åtgärden eller "
+"välj <guilabel>Återställ rastrering</guilabel> för att återställa lagrets "
+"tidigare typ."
 
